                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "rbac-design-000070",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "rbac-design-000004"
                  },
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#000000",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#000000",
                  "font": "PingFang SC;16;0",
                  "showShadow": false,
                  "left": 50,
                  "top": 755,
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 99,
                  "text": "配置：app.backend-strategy\nstructured 或 ddd\n启动时只注册对应实现 Bean",
                  "wordWrap": true
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "rbac-design-000071",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "rbac-design-000004"
                  },
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#000000",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#000000",
                  "font": "PingFang SC;16;0",
                  "showShadow": false,
                  "left": 1050,
                  "top": 900,
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 99,
                  "text": "两套实现使用同一数据库、同一 API\nCloneFactory 用于边界对象拷贝\n各可执行层通过 Logback 记日志",
                  "wordWrap": true
                },
                {
                  "_type": "UMLNoteView",
                  "_id": "rbac-design-000072",
                  "_parent": {
                    "$ref": "rbac-design-000004"
                  },
                  "parentStyle": false,
                  "lineColor": "#000000",
                  "fillColor": "#ffffff",
                  "fontColor": "#000000",
                  "font": "PingFang SC;16;0",
                  "showShadow": false,
                  "left": 50,
                  "top": 985,
                  "width": 965,
                  "height": 99,
                  "text": "虚线开箭头：源码依赖，箭头指向被依赖包；图中位置不表示调用顺序。\nService 通过 service.port 内的持久化接口调用 Infrastructure 适配器。\n运行调用路径：Controller -> 用例接口 -> 被选中的 Service -> 持久化端口 -> JPA 适配器。",
                  "wordWrap": true
                }
              ],
